of the `F₂₀` resolvent (as polynomials in `x 0, …, x 4`) agree.  Both are
literals certified step by step: `E5_4` (the e_4 recurrence, `E·_·_ck`) and
the Horner chain (`e4rhs_dec`). -/
theorem e4dec : e4LHS = e4RHS := e4rhs_dec.symm

